reference points
  P(y) = (-1)^y            I = 1.000000   <- ARCH extremal
  P(y) = 1  (constant)     I = 0.000000
  P(y) = (-1)^y 2^-y       I = 0.750000   <- alternating but decaying

THM-3010 ballot columns: circuit, its sign pattern, and I
  binom(2k,k)          circuit +++++++++++  changes=0  I(values)=0.405749
  Catalan              circuit +++++++++++  changes=0  I(values)=0.383177
  binom(2k,k-1) [B]    circuit ---++++++++  changes=1  I(values)=0.425865
